    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Maher Auctioneers are delighted to present this unique mixed-use property located on Main Street, Fethard, Co. Tipperary, comprising a substantial commercial premises together with two separate residential dwellings, all set on extensive grounds in the heart of one of Ireland's finest medieval towns.\r\nOffering exceptional versatility, this landmark property presents an outstanding opportunity for investors, business owners, or those seeking a live-work lifestyle. The combination of a commercial premises, two independent residences, generous gardens, and town-centre location makes this a truly rare offering.\r\nThe main residence is an impressive three-storey home offering spacious and well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor comprises a generous kitchen and dining area, while the first floor features a bright sitting room, a separate living room, dining room and a family bathroom. From this level, the property enjoys stunning views over the beautifully maintained walled gardens. The top floor accommodates three spacious bedrooms together with a second bathroom, providing excellent family accommodation.\r\nThe second residence is a self-contained two-storey home, ideal for extended family, guest accommodation, rental income, or staff accommodation. The ground floor comprises a kitchen/dining area and comfortable living room with patio doors out to the garden, while upstairs offers two bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. A large walled garden provides exceptional privacy and outdoor space, with the historic Fethard Town Wall forming part of the rear boundary, creating a truly unique and character-filled setting. The property also benefits from vehicular access directly from Main Street, together with a double garage incorporating a lofted storage area, providing excellent storage, workshop, or future potential (subject to the necessary consents).\r\nLocated in the centre of Fethard, the property enjoys immediate access to an excellent range of amenities including cafés, restaurants, shops, schools, sporting facilities, and local services. Fethard is renowned for its rich medieval heritage, thriving community, and excellent connectivity, with Cashel, Clonmel, and the M8 motorway all within a short drive.\r\nThis exceptional property offers endless possibilities for commercial, residential, or investment use, combining historic charm, substantial accommodation, and a prime town-centre location.\r\nFor any further inquiries, feel free to reach out to our Sales Team via email or phone. Please note that we have not tested any appliances, fixtures, fittings, or services, and interested parties are encouraged to carry out their own investigations regarding their functionality. All measurements are approximate, and photographs are provided for guidance only. Viewing strictly by appointment only through Maher Auctioneers, 062-61221."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Unique mixed-use opportunity – Commercial premises with two separate residential dwellings.\r\nPrime Main Street location – Situated in the heart of historic Fethard.\r\nExceptional outdoor space – Large private walled gardens with the historic Fethard Town Wall forming part of the rear boundary.\r\nExcellent versatility – Double garage with loft, rear vehicular access, and superb potential for investment, business, or multi-generational living."
      },
